<%# crosswire:contract v1 %>
<%#
  Deliberately dumb — every class decision lives in Crosswire::UI::Card, so this
  file is safe to restyle, shadow, or eject. See docs/DECISIONS.md D6.

  Header and footer render ONLY when present (the caller named that slot) — an
  absent slot emits no wrapper element at all, not an empty one. Body always
  renders: either the caller's `c.body { ... }` content, or (arity-0 shorthand) the
  whole block's own captured output.

  Locals:
    card    Crosswire::UI::Card
    header  String or nil — captured `c.header { ... }` content
    body    String or nil — captured `c.body { ... }` content, or the whole block
    footer  String or nil — captured `c.footer { ... }` content
%>
<div <%= cw_attrs(card.root_attrs) %>>
  <% if header %>
    <div <%= cw_attrs(card.header_attrs) %>><%= header %></div>
  <% end %>
  <div <%= cw_attrs(card.body_attrs) %>><%= body %></div>
  <% if footer %>
    <div <%= cw_attrs(card.footer_attrs) %>><%= footer %></div>
  <% end %>
</div>
